---
description: Never attribute git commits or PRs to Cursor
alwaysApply: true
---

# No Cursor commit attribution

- Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor` or `Made-with: Cursor` to commit messages or PR bodies.
- If a commit message gains those trailers automatically, amend or rewrite the message to remove them before pushing.
- Prefer the user's git identity only as author/committer.
